        '0.16': "Know that to be indestructible by which all this is pervaded. No one can bring about the destruction of that imperishable one.",
        '0.17': "These bodies of the eternal, indestructible and immeasurable embodied soul are said to have an end. Therefore fight, O Bhārata.",
